<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>HeyGen is a revolutionary AI video platform that enables anyone to create professional spokesperson videos using AI avatars. With advanced voice cloning technology and multilingual video translation capabilities, HeyGen has become the go-to solution for businesses and creators who need scalable video content without the cost and complexity of traditional video production.</p>
<p>What makes HeyGen stand out is its incredibly realistic AI avatars and instant voice cloning feature. You can create a digital twin of yourself or choose from over 100 pre-made avatars, then generate videos in 40+ languages with natural lip-sync and expressions. The platform's video translation feature can take any video and automatically translate it while matching the speaker's lip movements to the new language.</p>
<p>Used by over 5 million people worldwide, HeyGen is perfect for creating marketing videos, product demos, training content, social media posts, and personalized outreach at scale. The platform's ease of use and professional results have made it a favorite among marketers, sales teams, educators, and content creators.</p>
<h2 id="features">Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon">👤</div>
<h4>AI Avatars</h4>
<p>Choose from 100+ realistic AI avatars or create a custom avatar. Avatars speak naturally with authentic facial expressions and gestures.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path><path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"></path><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="19" y2="23"></line><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="23" y2="23"></line></svg></div>
<h4>Instant Voice Cloning</h4>
<p>Clone any voice with just 2 minutes of audio. Create videos that sound exactly like you or your brand spokesperson in minutes.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon">🌍</div>
<h4>Video Translation</h4>
<p>Translate videos to 40+ languages with automatic lip-sync. Perfect for reaching global audiences without re-recording content.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg></div>
<h4>Custom Avatars</h4>
<p>Create a personalized avatar that looks and sounds like you. Record once, generate unlimited videos with your digital twin.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M11 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7"/><path d="M18.5 2.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5z"/></svg></div>
<h4>Script to Video</h4>
