<h2 id="pros-cons">Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
<div class="pros-cons-grid">
<div class="pros-box">
<h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Advantages</h4>
<ul>
<li>Incredibly realistic AI avatars and voices</li>
<li>Instant voice cloning with just 2 minutes of audio</li>
<li>Video translation to 40+ languages with lip-sync</li>
<li>Easy-to-use interface, no video editing skills needed</li>
<li>Custom avatar creation for personal branding</li>
<li>Large template library for quick starts</li>
<li>Personalization at scale for marketing</li>
<li>Fast video generation and rendering</li>
<li>Professional quality output up to 4K</li>
<li>Great for sales, marketing, and training</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="cons-box">
<h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg> Disadvantages</h4>
<ul>
<li>Custom avatar creation requires higher-tier plan</li>
<li>Credit-based pricing can get expensive</li>
<li>Limited free plan (only 1 minute)</li>
<li>Some avatars can look slightly artificial</li>
<li>Learning curve for advanced features</li>
<li>Voice cloning quality varies by input audio</li>
<li>Export times can be slow during peak hours</li>
<li>Limited video editing capabilities</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
